    "steam_appid": 1515370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/addb5efabcea9d82988757e4883828cc.poster.avif?t=1733297861\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/addb5efabcea9d82988757e4883828cc.webm?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/addb5efabcea9d82988757e4883828cc.mp4?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Life at the border crossing is like a lottery - I never know what the next day will bring. People want to move all kinds of goods, and I help them. I love this job.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/0555d4861fd49d1bd81cf00a9e475450.poster.avif?t=1733297861\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/0555d4861fd49d1bd81cf00a9e475450.webm?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/0555d4861fd49d1bd81cf00a9e475450.mp4?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>I fail sometimes, but I know how much people are willing to pay for shifting goods. The rangers are becoming more and more vigilant, so my ideas need to be more and more ... creative.<br><br>But this adrenaline rush during the implementation of my plan ... This joy when I manage to outsmart the border guards ... You have to find out for yourself!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/3b0447aeb7c68fcdaba917bb419c6da6.poster.avif?t=1733297861\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/3b0447aeb7c68fcdaba917bb419c6da6.webm?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/3b0447aeb7c68fcdaba917bb419c6da6.mp4?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br>- Open world 3D puzzle game!<br>- Immersive and realistic FPP experience of being smuggler!<br>- Procedurally generated content and missions!<br>- Advanced crafting and tools upgrades!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/addb5efabcea9d82988757e4883828cc.poster.avif?t=1733297861\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/addb5efabcea9d82988757e4883828cc.webm?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/addb5efabcea9d82988757e4883828cc.mp4?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Life at the border crossing is like a lottery - I never know what the next day will bring. People want to move all kinds of goods, and I help them. I love this job.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/0555d4861fd49d1bd81cf00a9e475450.poster.avif?t=1733297861\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/0555d4861fd49d1bd81cf00a9e475450.webm?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/0555d4861fd49d1bd81cf00a9e475450.mp4?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>I fail sometimes, but I know how much people are willing to pay for shifting goods. The rangers are becoming more and more vigilant, so my ideas need to be more and more ... creative.<br><br>But this adrenaline rush during the implementation of my plan ... This joy when I manage to outsmart the border guards ... You have to find out for yourself!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/3b0447aeb7c68fcdaba917bb419c6da6.poster.avif?t=1733297861\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/3b0447aeb7c68fcdaba917bb419c6da6.webm?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1515370/extras/3b0447aeb7c68fcdaba917bb419c6da6.mp4?t=1733297861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br>- Open world 3D puzzle game!<br>- Immersive and realistic FPP experience of being smuggler!<br>- Procedurally generated content and missions!<br>- Advanced crafting and tools upgrades!",
